<p>Creates a time distortion in a radius of <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">2, 2, 2, 3, 3</acronym> that lasts for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">6, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> turns, decreasing global speed by 60% for 3 turns and inflicting <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">35, 47, 56, 64, 71</acronym> temporal damage each turn to all targets within the area.</p><p>The slow effect and damage dealt will scale with your Spellpower.</p>